title: "Compute-Validate-Explain (CVE): Trustworthy LLM-assisted experiment analysis"
abstract: >-
  A framework and open benchmark for enforcing and measuring numerical grounding
  in LLM-assisted analysis of controlled experiments: a deterministic layer
  computes every statistic, a validation layer verifies that each number in the
  model's write-up is traceable to a computed value, and the language model is
  restricted to interpretation.
type: software
